        "html": "250 experience <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Combat_XP_lamp_(Diamond_in_the_Rough)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">lamp</a> in one of the following skills: <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Attack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Attack</a>, <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Strength\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Strength</a>, <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Defence\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Defence</a>, <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Constitution\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Constitution</a>, <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Ranged\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ranged</a>, <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Magic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Magic</a>, <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Necromancy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Necromancy</a> or <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Prayer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Prayer</a>",
        "text": "250 experience lamp in one of the following skills: Attack, Strength, Defence, Constitution, Ranged, Magic, Necromancy or Prayer",
        "subs": []
      },
      {
        "html": "1 <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Sapphire\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">sapphire</a>, 1 <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Emerald\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">emerald</a>, 1 <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Ruby\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ruby</a> (if picked up from <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Dung_kalphite\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">dung kalphites</a>)",
        "text": "1 sapphire, 1 emerald, 1 ruby (if picked up from dung kalphites)",
        "subs": []
      },
      {
        "html": "Access to the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Kalphite_nursery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Kalphite nursery</a>, where you can obtain <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Aten_(Heru%27s_shield)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Aten (Heru&#39;s shield)</a><sup>(<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Aten\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">override</a>)</sup> and <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Uraeus_(Apep%27s_axe)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Uraeus (Apep&#39;s axe)</a><sup>(<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Uraeus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">override</a>)</sup> from slicing <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Dung_kalphite\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">dung kalphites</a>",
        "text": "Access to the Kalphite nursery, where you can obtain Aten (Heru's shield)(override) and Uraeus (Apep's axe)(override) from slicing dung kalphites",
        "subs": []
      }
    ],
    "groups": [],
    "notes": [
      "Players with 80 <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Mining\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Mining</a> (boosts may be used, must be visible) can mine a crack in the room below the quicksand for 20,000 experience and access <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Scabaras_tomb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Scabaras tomb</a>, which contains a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Scabaras_mask\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Scabaras mask</a> and a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Was\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Was</a> (sceptre). To reach the fissure room, go down the well (north-west of the Kalphite Lair, fairy ring <b>B</b><b>I</b><b>Q</b>) and go in the tunnel in the east wall of the Kalphite nursery. Then go through the tunnel all the way to the other side and enter. You will find yourself in the room below the quicksand."
    ]
  },
